  "result": "The refusals are in `acceptInvitation`, and the age limit is a constant in the same file.\n\n- **Refusals:** `acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` throws three errors, checked in this order: \"That invitation has been revoked\" (`revokedAt` set), \"That invitation has already been accepted\" (`acceptedAt` set), and \"That invitation has expired\" (`expiresAt <= now`). A cancelled invitation is covered by the revoked check.\n- **Age setting:** `DEFAULT_EXPIRY_DAYS = 14` at line 26 of the same file. `inviteMembers` passes it to `invitationRepo.insertInvitation`, which turns it into the stored `expiresAt` timestamp.\n\nThe landing page at `src/app/(auth)/invite/[token]/page.tsx` shows a generic \"may have been revoked\" message, but it does not make the decision.\n\nANSWER: src/server/services/invitation-service.ts",
